<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">The statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015 (Ind AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognized accounting practices and policies to the extent applicable.      The above results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors of the Company at their respective meetings held on July 18, 2024. The results are subjected to Limited Review by the auditors of the Company in terms of Regulation 33 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (LODR).      Other income in standalone financial results includes dividend income from subsidiaries. Dividend income from subsidiary of INR 35.43 Million Quarter ended 30th June, 24 (INR 924.14 million Quarter ended March 31, 2024, INR 49.24 Mio for Quarter ended Jun 30, 2023, INR 959.68 million for HY ended 30th June 24, INR 988.49 Mio for HY ended 30th June 2023 and Year ended December 31, 2023 INR 1,097.93 million).      The Company has changed its name from Mahindra CIE Automotive Limited to CIE Automotive India Limited during the previous year ended December 31, 2023.      The Board of Directors of the Company at their meeting held on February 19, 2024 recommended final dividend of Rs 5.00 per equity share of Rs 10 each fully paid up for financial year 2023 which has been paid during quarter ended June 30, 2024.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
